<title>DUBAI: Kuwait cuts June propane, butane unchanged - KPC.</title>
<headline>Kuwait cuts June propane, butane unchanged - KPC.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait Petroleum Corp (KPC) has set its June liquefied petroleum gas (LPG) prices at $175 a tonne for propane and $192.00 for butane, KPC said on Sunday.</p>
<p>Propane fell by $4.00 and butane was unchanged.</p>
</text>
